.npmrc
settings.local.*

# Temporary files, Office locks, journals and backups
~$*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.old
*.log
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
*.dmp
backups/
.pasport-transactions*/
.baseline*/
.history/
.state/
runtime/
Резервные копии*/
